## Allow asset hud settings
!assets/voxygen/i18n/*/hud/settings.ron

## Allow corpus-fan evidence logs — these are ATTESTATION, not build noise.
## Every wave's `COMMIT=` line (the thing that makes a fan result citable) lives
## in a raw pool *.log, so the blanket `*.log` above silently excluded the
## provenance for every determinism claim we make. Ignored files do not appear
## in `git status`, so "nothing untracked" and "everything ignored" printed the
## same thing for weeks. Scoped to the evidence tree only.
!bastion-test-evidence/**/*.log

